  "description": "Dependency-free boolean expression toolkit in ONE package (since v4.0): provably minimal results with explicit proof status (exact Quine-McCluskey backend), built-in CDCL SAT solver with equivalence checking and counterexamples, Tseitin CNF, ROBDD and d-DNNF model counting, truth tables with don't-cares, multi-output CSV minimization, and DIMACS/WCNF/OPB/BLIF/Verilog import/export. Ships all seven library assemblies; no third-party dependency.",
